\nX_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(X, y, test_size=0.2, stratify=y, random_state=42)\nprint(X_train.shape, X_test.shape)","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-10-01T16:49:46.821704Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-10-01T16:49:46.821516Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-10-01T16:49:46.835501Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-10-01T16:49:46.834518Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["(491, 10) (123, 10)\n"]}],"execution_count":4},{"id":"3b5b0f59","cell_type":"markdown","source":"## 3. Train four models\nLogistic Regression, Decision Tree, Random Forest and KNN. Decision Tree, Random Forest and KNN are lightly tuned via cross-validated grid search (F1 scoring); all use a stratified 5-fold CV.","metadata":{}},{"id":"700e1b9f","cell_type":"code","source":"from sklearn.model_selection import GridSearchCV\ncv = StratifiedKFold(5, shuffle=True, random_state=42)\nconfigs = {\n 'Logistic Regression': (LogisticRegression(max_iter=1000), {'clf__C':[0.01,0.1,1,10]}),\n 'Decision Tree': (DecisionTreeClassifier(random_state=42), {'clf__max_depth':[2,3,4,5,7],'clf__min_samples_leaf':[5,10,20]}),\n 'Random Forest': (RandomForestClassifier(random_state=42), {'clf__n_estimators':[200,400],'clf__max_depth':[3,5,8],'clf__min_samples_leaf':[3,5,10]}),\n 'KNN': (KNeighborsClassifier(), {'clf__n_neighbors':[5,9,15,21,31],'clf__weights':['uniform','distance']}),\n}\nfitted, rows = {}, []\nfor name,(est,grid) in configs.items():\n    pipe = Pipeline([('pre',make_pre()),('clf',est)])\n    gs = GridSearchCV(pipe, grid, cv=cv, scoring='f1', n_jobs=-1).fit(X_train,y_train)\n    m = gs.best_estimator_; fitted[name]=m\n    pred, proba = m.predict(X_test), m.predict_proba(X_test)[:,1]\n    rows.append({'Model':name,'CV F1':gs.best_score_,\n        'Accuracy':accuracy_score(y_test,pred),'Precision':precision_score(y_test,pred),\n        'Recall':recall_score(y_test,pred),'F1-score':f1_score(y_test,pred),\n        'ROC-AUC':roc_auc_score(y_test,proba)})\